OVERVIEW: Log in to Apple Developer Services

USAGE: xtool auth login [--username <username>] [--password <password>] [--mode <mode>]

OPTIONS:
  -u, --username <username>
                          Apple ID
  -p, --password <password>
  -m, --mode <mode>       (values: key, password)
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

